[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-073
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: MILSTD498 Documentation
STATEMENT: This repository contains MILSTD498 (Military Standard 498) document templates in multiple formats. MILSTD498 is a United States military standard that defines the software development and documentation process for software systems.
RATIONALE: Converted from README.md heading.

