UID: REQ-088
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Using StrictDoc Files
STATEMENT: The StrictDoc (.sdoc) files can be used with StrictDoc to generate various output formats: 
RATIONALE: Converted from README.md heading.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-089
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Generate HTML
STATEMENT: strictdoc export formats=html outputdir=output/ .
RATIONALE: Converted from README.md heading.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-090
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Generate PDF
STATEMENT: strictdoc export formats=pdf outputdir=output/ .
RATIONALE: Converted from README.md heading.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-091
STATUS: Draft
